    {
      "claim": "PAY-4031 occurred when the acquirer timed out on the 3-D Secure challenge, causing checkouts to fail while checkout waited 10 seconds for the challenge response.",
      "page": "handover-2025-10-20",
      "quote": "PAY-4031 came back on Tuesday evening: the acquirer timed out on the 3-D Secure challenge and 41 checkouts failed in about 25 minutes. The checkout waits 10 s for the 3-D Secure answer."
    },
    {
      "claim": "The issue was resolved when Leo increased the 3-D Secure wait duration from 10 seconds to 25 seconds, after which PAY-4031 did not recur.",
      "page": "handover-2025-11-03",
      "quote": "The PAY-4031 follow-up from two weeks ago is done: on Thursday Leo raised the 3-D Secure wait from 10 s to 25 s. We monitored traffic on payments across ap-northeast, us-east, and eu-west following the adjustment, and PAY-4031 has not come back since."
    }
  ],
  "not_in_pages": []
}

